    "Rule 4 Reproduction: a dead cell with exactly 3 live neighbors becomes alive — (1,1) is in the next generation of [(0,0),(1,0),(0,1)]",
  );
  it.todo(
    "Block still life stays unchanged — [(0,0),(1,0),(0,1),(1,1)] → the same 4 cells",
  );
